{
  "id": "lost-origin-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Lost Origin Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Lost Origin prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 27–28 August and 3–4 September 2022, the first official prereleases since February 2020, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program. Each box held four Lost Origin booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Lost Origin logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Kingdra, Gengar and Hisuian Arcanine, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and again Astral Radiance's non-holo Irida and Brilliant Stars' non-holo Professor's Research.",
